                            jcr:lastModified="{Date}2024-09-20T08:14:53.298-04:00"
                            jcr:lastModifiedBy="NANDIVX5"
                            jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                            sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                            text="&lt;p>We believe that being a responsible company involves being an active contributor to the communities in which we live and do business. Our commitment to our community has been a part of our DNA from the beginning. It is who we are.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>Our vision is to help build a sustainable future by ensuring our investments of time and resources go further to help people – directly. We proudly serve our communities through our philanthropy, employee giving and volunteerism.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>Through our work to address some of the most complex health issues, we can align our&amp;nbsp;business focus and corporate responsibilities, and in doing so create shared value. We strive to develop and implement innovative, patient-focussed approaches to addressing health care challenges in our society.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>New approaches are required to address the challenges our society faces today, and we are committed to be part of the solution,&amp;nbsp;to help build a sustainable future for our health care system.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                            textIsRich="true"/>
                    </container_2118357946>
